    "sections": {
        "description": "Butcher Shop is a bold, warm WordPress block theme for butcher counters, meat markets, delicatessens, smokehouses and farm shops. Built for the Site Editor, it ships with a full-width hero, a weekly cuts showcase, a dry-aging story band, butcher box cards, cooking guides and a smokehouse footer with counter hours, all made from core WordPress blocks. Flame red and ember orange tones, self-hosted Archivo headings and Inter body type give the layout a confident, appetising feel, while fluid typography, generous spacing and accessible colour contrast keep it readable on every screen. Global Styles, block patterns, block styles, template editing and translation-ready strings make the whole site editable without touching code."
    },
